         body='THREE. A list of kinds, or a list of classes.\n  THE LIST OF KINDS (short names kept in the code):\n    gift -> Note.Gift, coupon -> Note.Coupon\n  THE HONEST NOTE\'S JSON:\n    "gift":{"type":"gift","message":"Happy birthday"}\n    -> 2 lines, total 9200 cents\n  THE FORGED NOTE\'S JSON (a class name as the kind):\n    "gift":{"type":\n      "com.jk.explore.security.jacksondeser.TempCleaner",\n      "path":"<marker file>"}\n      -> refused (unknown type id)\n      -> marker file exists afterwards: true',
